sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (wasichai-ui)
    participant S as Security filter (JWT)
    participant R as RecordController
    participant P as Permissions / field rules
    participant D as Record store (SQL)
    participant A as Audit log
    participant Q as AutomationDispatcher
    B->>S: PUT /api/objects/licencia/records/{id}<br/>Authorization, If-Match, X-Change-Reason
    S->>S: verify HS256 token, tenant = org claim
    S->>R: CurrentUser
    R->>P: UPDATE on object? fields writable?<br/>appendOnly / apiOnly / requiresReason
    P-->>R: allowed
    R->>D: UPDATE … WHERE organization_id AND updated_at = If-Match
    D-->>R: row (or 412 when stale)
    R->>A: append entry (changes, reason, correlation id)
    R->>Q: match rules, queue automation_runs PENDING (same transaction)
    R-->>B: 200 record + new ETag
